Halo speaks AirSIM's pairing, VoWLAN and Relay protocols to AirSIM apps the
user installs separately (as the iPhone client for an Android phone, and as
the Android agent for AirSIM's iPhone app). It reimplements the protocols and
does not ship AirSIM's apps or Relay. The code is in:
  internal/airsim
  internal/server/airsim*.go

